	"system": {
		"description": "<p>With a menacing glare, you invoke your foe’s misdeeds and chastise them for their wickedness. Make an intimidation check against your target’s combat maneuver DC. On a success, your target has disadvantage on making attack rolls against targets other than you until the end of your next turn. You may repeat this bonus action against the same target without expending exertion in the following round.</p>",
